av:TrackRequirementShape a sh:NodeShape ; rdfs:comment "Structural subset only. One logical required or optional track at the wire or delivered boundary. Equal dcterms:identifier values join its wire and delivered contracts within an alternative."@en ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ; sh:property _:b0525, _:b0616, _:b0687, _:b0695, _:b0773 ; sh:targetClass av:TrackRequirement .
